  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3201.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3201.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to implement the NOx budget program established by RSA 125-J:2 and RSA 125-J:2-a, which requires reductions in ozone season NOx emissions from NOx budget sources, as defined in RSA 125-J:1, XIX-b, in order to further the effort to achieve the national ambient air quality standards (NAAQS) for ozone.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3200.html"
}
